    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-3885f05e-d786-4ddf-a899-0783b587cacc-0",
      "sceneId": "scene-3885f05e-d786-4ddf-a899-0783b587cacc",
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 6.577,
      "text": "模型看起来记住了前文，但只要离开当前输入，它并不会自动保留这段对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-3885f05e-d786-4ddf-a899-0783b587cacc-1",
      "sceneId": "scene-3885f05e-d786-4ddf-a899-0783b587cacc",
      "start": 6.577,
      "end": 9.952,
      "text": "真正参与这次生成的内容，叫做上下文。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-e17f8507-528d-4d60-8f61-f67d4d421026-0",
      "sceneId": "scene-e17f8507-528d-4d60-8f61-f67d4d421026",
      "start": 10.602,
      "end": 13.462,
      "text": "输入文本先按分词器切成 token。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-e17f8507-528d-4d60-8f61-f67d4d421026-1",
      "sceneId": "scene-e17f8507-528d-4d60-8f61-f67d4d421026",
      "start": 13.462,
      "end": 18.388,
      "text": "每个 token 变成离散线索，再被转换成模型可以计算的向量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-0e8ea1e7-c60b-44e1-9373-f1c2107a0d8b-0",
      "sceneId": "scene-0e8ea1e7-c60b-44e1-9373-f1c2107a0d8b",
      "start": 19.038,
      "end": 23.705,
      "text": "在注意力层里，每个 token 会和前文计算相关权重。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-0e8ea1e7-c60b-44e1-9373-f1c2107a0d8b-1",
      "sceneId": "scene-0e8ea1e7-c60b-44e1-9373-f1c2107a0d8b",
      "start": 23.705,
      "end": 27.162,
      "text": "权重决定混合多少信息，但它不是人类解释。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-0903610a-37ef-4d06-8548-afbd9ba442ce-0",
      "sceneId": "scene-0903610a-37ef-4d06-8548-afbd9ba442ce",
      "start": 27.812,
      "end": 29.312,
      "text": "位置编码补上词序；"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-0903610a-37ef-4d06-8548-afbd9ba442ce-1",
      "sceneId": "scene-0903610a-37ef-4d06-8548-afbd9ba442ce",
      "start": 29.312,
      "end": 33.647,
      "text": "自回归生成时，因果掩码会挡住尚未出现的 token。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-context-window-001-0",
      "sceneId": "scene-context-window-001",
      "start": 34.297,
      "end": 38.002,
      "text": "模型一次推理只能读取上下文窗口里的内容。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-context-window-001-1",
      "sceneId": "scene-context-window-001",
      "start": 38.002,
      "end": 43.374,
      "text": "窗口大小因模型和配置而异，旧内容如何保留，取决于产品策略。"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-context-v2-scene-takeaway-context-001-0",
      "sceneId": "scene-takeaway-context-001",
      "start": 44.024,
